    "intro_narrative": "The surface of the Earth has been reduced to toxic ash, but deep underground, Bunker 42 holds the last hope for planetary restoration. You have breached the rusted airlock, discovering a labyrinth of dormant pre-war systems covered in centuries of dust. Your ultimate objective is to restart the Bunker Mainframe Core to reengage the atmospheric terraforming array. However, the ancient systems are heavily compartmentalized and completely offline. You must scavenge the facility, reboot peripheral nodes, and carefully trace the archaic data flows to bring the bunker back to life before your hazard suit's life support runs dry.",
